<section class="ter-gm-panel"><h2>GM Element Controls</h2><fieldset><legend>Mass Token Elements</legend><p>Uses controlled tokens first; if none are controlled, uses your targeted tokens.</p><div class="ter-two"><label>Element<select name="massElement">{{#each elements}}<option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label>Remove Element<select name="removeElement"><option value="__all">All Elements</option>{{#each elements}}<option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label></div><div class="ter-actions"><button type="button" data-action="mass-apply">Apply Element</button><button type="button" data-action="mass-remove">Remove Element</button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Actor Infusion</legend><p>Infusion controls whether an actor can inflict its active element on hit.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Actor</th><th>Infused</th><th>Active Element</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each actors}}<tr data-actor="{{uuid}}"><td>{{name}}</td><td><input type="checkbox" data-field="infused" {{#if infused}}checked{{/if}}></td><td><select data-field="element"><option value="">None</option>{{#each ../elements}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if (eq id ../activeElement)}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></fieldset></section>